{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds","id":1199576,"title":"Other Worlds","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-25T21:11:28-07:00","id":1199576,"title":"Other Worlds","content":"I remember back in 2E it was stated there are no other worlds like Creation out in the Wyld. But what about nowm. Is there room in 3E for there to be other worlds, even big ones like Creation?<br /> <br /> I have an idea in the works and it relies on this as a basis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-25T22:00:21-07:00","id":1199588,"title":"","content":"If anything, late 2E specifically hinted at the possibility of other worlds of some kind out in the Wyld, as Gaia is off seraching the Faraway on her comet.<br /> <br /> In 3E, the Scorpion Empire presumably came from somewhere!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-25T22:13:57-07:00","id":1199591,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1199588#post1199588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If anything, late 2E specifically hinted at the possibility of other worlds of some kind out in the Wyld, as Gaia is off seraching the Faraway on her comet.<br /> <br /> In 3E, the Scorpion Empire presumably came from somewhere!</div> </div> </div> </div>The Scorpion Empire? Please enlighten a 2e doofus and rabid fan of the otherworlds.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Never not tired","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12001-the-nilbog","name":"The Nilbog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-25T22:30:03-07:00","id":1199596,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Nilbog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1199591#post1199591\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Scorpion Empire? Please enlighten a 2e doofus and rabid fan of the otherworlds.</div> </div> </div> </div>They\u2019re invaders back from the First Age who are mentioned in the origin of one of the Warstriders in Arms of the Chosen. We know very little about them other than they are described as \u201cFace-Snaked\u201d... not \u201cSnake-Faced\u201d... \u201cFace-Snaked\u201d; they came from a place \u201cthe Second Age has no name for or language to describe\u201d; and those regions that fell to them were \u201cconsigned to the rapacity of time.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-25T23:16:12-07:00","id":1199602,"title":"","content":"They also get a mention in Masters of Jade.<br /> <br /> It's unclear as to whether there are stable places in the Wyld that are unconnected to Creation, but there's definitely more out there than just Raksha and their works.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-25T23:54:04-07:00","id":1199610,"title":"","content":"I am curious as well. The big thing to wonder about is how in 2nd ed the creation of the Loom of Fate and Creation invented conventional causality and time. So if it is still the same it would be odd to have worlds older then Creation that are at all similar to Creation. This brings to question if the Scorpion Empire is tied to this causality/time backlash since they are somehow temporally themed. Perhaps for them Time works like Space?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T00:12:37-07:00","id":1199613,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds#post1199576\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I remember back in 2E it was stated there are no other worlds like Creation out in the Wyld. But what about nowm. Is there room in 3E for there to be other worlds, even big ones like Creation?</div> </div> </div> </div>Given some of the imperatives of the prior development team, Third Edition is probably <i>less</i> amenable to such a thing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have an idea in the works and it relies on this as a basis.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bThen just do it: don't forget the Golden Rule.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1199588#post1199588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In 3E, the Scorpion Empire presumably came from somewhere!</div> </div> </div> </div>The raksha come from somewhere as well. That doesn't necessarily make it a place that you can live.<br /> <br /> \u200b<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T00:18:27-07:00","id":1199614,"title":"","content":"Wait, in what way is 3E less amenable to this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T00:24:25-07:00","id":1199617,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1199614#post1199614\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait, in what way is 3E less amenable to this?</div> </div> </div> </div>Because the emphasis of the game is on playing larger-than-life characters in the vibrant tapestry that is Creation; the solution to &quot;I think Creation is a boring place&quot; is <i>not</i> to offer massive and numerous alternative worlds (since given time, one would come to think them boring as well), but to <i>show how Creation is not a boring place</i>.<br /> <br /> The previous set of Devs, for instance, agreed with me when I asserted that constant reference from 2e books to realms of arbitrary size only served to make Creation feel small and unimportant, which is kind of a bad idea when that's the setting in which games are intended to take place.<br /> <br /> There <i>are</i> other worlds, mind, but they are not &quot;like Creation.&quot; Karvara, the behemoth-turned-warstrider who originated in legendary Zen-Mu, shows that not only is Zen-Mu not like Creation - it may well be antithetical to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 03-26-2018, 04:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T00:31:00-07:00","id":1199619,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1199613#post1199613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The raksha come from somewhere as well. That doesn't necessarily make it a place that you can live.<br /> <br /> \u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>Was that a requisite to the question?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T00:49:40-07:00","id":1199622,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1199619#post1199619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Was that a requisite to the question?</div> </div> </div> </div>The OP did specify worlds &quot;like Creation.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T01:06:20-07:00","id":1199627,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1199622#post1199622\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The OP did specify worlds &quot;like Creation.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> They said &quot;other worlds, even big ones like Creation&quot;. The &quot;like Creation&quot; in that sentence a) refers to size, and b) is a statement of inclusive possibilities, and not to the exclusion of other possibilities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T01:21:57-07:00","id":1199630,"title":"","content":"I think the Developers don't want to make places that overshadow Creation, but I don't think they are completely against realms that rival Creation beyond the already established Realms.<br /> <br /> In my Canon there are exceptional realms that exist, such as a Primordial Solar System, and secret worlds like Exandria.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T01:32:47-07:00","id":1199636,"title":"","content":"I think Ink monkeys made a creation like world in the world called &quot;Crajeon&quot; (or something like that&quot;). It had been made before the fall of the primodials. The Primodials commanded Sol to burn the world, which he did. It was hinted that there still was this burning or sorched copy of creation out there.<br /> <br /> I can't remember who made it though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/854-light-hero","name":"light-hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T02:20:54-07:00","id":1199642,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1199619#post1199619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Was that a requisite to the question?</div> </div> </div> </div>Read between the lines.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T03:22:18-07:00","id":1199646,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1199627#post1199627\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They said &quot;other worlds, even big ones like Creation&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, but they also said &quot;like Creation&quot; <i>unattached to size-related clauses</i> all the way back in the first sentence. This led me to believe that what they wanted was a world that was both &quot;big&quot; <i>and</i> like Creation, with the repetition serving to enforce it.<br /> <br /> I don't doubt that there are new worlds and weird worlds and big worlds out there, but a Wyld-seeker is never going to find another Creation.*<br /> <br /> <br /> ______________<br /> *Except in games where your ST makes a point of doing so, et cetera., et cetera.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 03-26-2018, 06:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T04:04:33-07:00","id":1199650,"title":"","content":"all I had was an idea for a new type of antagonist, and it only works if Creation isnt unique.<br /> <br /> Nevermind, aparently like all my idas it's a bad one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T04:33:47-07:00","id":1199654,"title":"","content":"Oh, c'mon, how would Creation's uniqueness possibly render your concept <i>utterly</i> unworkable?<br /> <br /> Just because something isn't compatible with canon doesn't mean it's a bad idea - please stop acting like that's what we're saying.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 03-26-2018, 02:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T04:46:15-07:00","id":1199657,"title":"","content":"Essentially, the basic game is not one that is really served by the Wyld being the basis for an elaborate multiverse. I would say that prominent among the reasons why is that the basic tension between Creation and the Wyld is that one is the real world and the other is the churning, devouring chaos beyond. It can contain discrete zones, but I think they ought not to be fully realized worlds.<br /> <br /> I would think of the Scorpion Empire as being like the Kree Empire; it's a setpiece to generate villains that superficially resembles an empire, but it's not really an elaborately detailed place containing people in the way that the Realm is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T04:49:01-07:00","id":1199658,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1199650#post1199650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">all I had was an idea for a new type of antagonist, and it only works if Creation isnt unique.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do as you please in your own games. Hell, tell us about your idea, so we can discuss that instead.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Nevermind, aparently like all my idas it's a bad one. </div> </div> </div>And stop doing this; it's crass.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T05:56:43-07:00","id":1199679,"title":"","content":"The wyld can totally spit up a fully functional alternate universe if you really want it to.<br /> <br /> It's the wyld. <i>I</i><i>nfinite</i> potential, yo.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T06:17:45-07:00","id":1199689,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1199679#post1199679\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The wyld can totally spit up a fully functional alternate universe if you really want it to.</div> </div> </div> </div>In the principle of the Golden Rule, sure.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's the wyld. <i>I</i><i>nfinite</i> potential, yo.</div> </div> </div> </div>That gives nothing to anchor to.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T08:27:48-07:00","id":1199719,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1199650#post1199650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nevermind, aparently like all my idas it's a bad one.</div> </div> </div> </div>You have got to stop doing this every time you ask about canon and it conflicts with what you want, or people give you feedback on something. Not a single person attacked your idea in this thread. Please stop acting like people are dogpiling you when they are not.<br /> <br /> The 3E answer to \u201cis Creation unique\u201d would almost certainly be \u201cWho knows!?\u201d Things like the Scorpion Empire exist as story hooks to show how weird and far afield you can go with the understood setting. \u201cThere are more things in Heaven and Earth, Horatio - than are dreamt of in your philosophy.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 03-26-2018, 01:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T10:50:15-07:00","id":1199762,"title":"","content":"Autochonia has about sixty-million people, the Octet, the two rogue Nations and thousands of square miles of exotic environment, aliens pirits, and an enitre unique sort of Exalt floating out beyond the Void in its own world.<br /> <br /> I would think that answers the questiont here to be honest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T21:23:06-07:00","id":1199937,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1199658#post1199658\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Do as you please in your own games.</div> </div> </div> </div>I dont have a game. Or a group. This forum was my only outlet for what little creativity I have left","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T23:20:16-07:00","id":1199953,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1199937#post1199937\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I dont have a game. Or a group. This forum was my only outlet for what little creativity I have left</div> </div> </div> </div>So find one. Or start your own. Put out feelers for game-inclined people in your area, or over the 'net.<br /> <br /> Also, you still haven't answered the question - what even<i> is</i> this concept of yours, that necessarily requires the existence of parallel Creations in order to be the slightest bit workable?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 03-27-2018, 02:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T23:25:28-07:00","id":1199954,"title":"","content":"Keeping in mind, this query is coming from the guy who introduced an NPC who claimed to be a time traveler.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T02:35:49-07:00","id":1199969,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1199937#post1199937\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I dont have a game. Or a group. This forum was my only outlet for what little creativity I have left</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bThen just talk about them. Stop asking preliminary questions that kind of edge carefully around what you have in mind, and then getting deeply offended at the responses. It's a terrible habit and it makes everybody miserable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T03:28:16-07:00","id":1199971,"title":"","content":"Their is the Nocturnal Exalted\u2019s idea if Kalpa you could use that D.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T13:30:09-07:00","id":1200543,"title":"","content":"As others stated, <i>just post the idea</i>. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds#post1199576\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I remember back in 2E it was stated there are no other worlds like Creation out in the Wyld</div> </div> </div> </div>Define &quot;worlds like Creation&quot;?<br /> <br /> <b>Cemunian, Constellation of Sinew and Dreams </b>was a Primordial who created it's own alternative-Creation, seeking to shove it over the default one. When the Unconquered Sun visited this false-Creation, he purified it via holocaust, annihilating it in a cataclysm of fire. <b>Note</b> - this does not mean it was dissolved into the Wyld.... but that a post-apocalyptic ruined world might exist out there, scorched beyond recognition. <b>Cemunian</b> was said to have fled to the Wyld (no note on whether it was ever slain - or simply created it's own pocket-world again, ignoring Creation).<br /> <br /> <b>Autochton, the Great Maker </b>is another Primordial who famously has entire civilizations of humans within himself.<br /> <br /> There are unknowns like <b>the Star Spanning Serpent</b> (which Merela climbed to reach the Daystar), <b>the Clouds that Rain Teeth</b> (which the Daystar could blow out of the sky), <b>Hunanura, the Heart-Frost Unending</b> (whose chill the Daystar could resist) and <b>Mabhaddoth, Architect of Locks</b> (who could close Creation off from the Daystar - but the Daystar could still spite it and return home). These are <i>possible </i>Primordials. In context, the Daystar &amp; Sol write-ups explains how the Primordials made themselves antagonists to them - to test - each time more amazed until finally acknowledging and naming him &quot;the Unconquered Sun&quot;.<br /> <br /> <b>Ramethus</b>, of the Aftershock War, was mentioned in Dreams of the First Age - but for this topic, I believe they alluded to &quot;at least one escaped Primordial&quot; in addition to Ramethus. This could be (any of the above) or yet another unknown entity.<br /> <br /> And if Cemunian's creation survived the &quot;purification by fire&quot;, it's not hard to imagine another Primordial tripping across it and deciding &quot;eh, I wouldn't build one myself, but I could totally refurnish this place to my liking&quot;.<br /> <br /> <hr /><br /> As others said, golden rule it.<br /> <br /> And the whole &quot;Creation feeling small&quot; and &quot;authors intent&quot; bit... decide if that <i>matters</i> to you. It's your game. Your narrative.<br /> <br /> Yu Shan is fairly big, but it's never been more than &quot;that cool place we'd like to wage a war of genocide upon&quot; for Abyssal / Infernal campaigns. I'm sure lots of Solar games look at the Realm the same way (just one giant prolonged war-game of sequential slaughter). I think hunting in Szoreny's forests would be awesome, but I'm sure some players would only want to shatter/burn the mirror/forest down. Mileage varies.<br /> <br /> And truth-be-told, the Underworld (with it's long-dead civilizations) is potentially vaster than Creation (imagine entire cities and roads and the like filling what - in the Age of Sorrows - are ruins or grasslands).<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Through indiscriminate suffering men know fear and fear is the most divine emotion.<br /> It is the stones for altars and the beginning of wisdom.<br /> Half gods are worshipped in wine and flowers. Real gods require blood.<br /> <b>- Their Eyes Were Watching God</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23843-salagimsim","name":"Salagimsim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23843_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"153"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T13:53:47-07:00","id":1200558,"title":"","content":"That is a brilliant Idea I never considered that another Primordial found the smoking Ruin of Cemmunian's PsuedoCreation and refurbished it! I love it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T17:30:33-07:00","id":1200650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1200558#post1200558\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That is a brilliant Idea I never considered that another Primordial found the smoking Ruin of Cemmunian's PsuedoCreation and refurbished it! I love it!</div> </div> </div> </div>Me, when i did mention it in my games, was a some sort of strange hybrid between Malfeas and the Underworld, in its &quot;world of horrors already before being overtaken by a cosmic holocaust&quot; condition.<br /> <br /> It does beggar the question of what Primordial <b>would</b> care to do so, when Cemmunian's world was basically meant/made as a big &quot;f**k you all!&quot; to his brothers &amp; sisters. It might disgust/horrify them even more than it did the UCS from that angle, i guess.<br /> <br /> As, an aside, some of the idiosyncratic locales and beings described in CoCD:Wyld might serve as seeds for the making of &quot;lost&quot; worlds in the Wyld, for the ST looking for just a little spur to direct one's imagination.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 04-02-2018, 10:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-24T08:35:06-07:00","id":1320499,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1200650#post1200650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Me, when i did mention it in my games, was a some sort of strange hybrid between Malfeas and the Underworld, in its &amp;quot;world of horrors already before being overtaken by a cosmic holocaust&amp;quot; condition.<br /> <br /> It does beggar the question of what Primordial <b>would</b> care to do so, when Cemmunian's world was basically meant/made as a big &amp;quot;f**k you all!&amp;quot; to his brothers &amp; sisters. It might disgust/horrify them even more than it did the UCS from that angle, i guess.<br /> <br /> As, an aside, some of the idiosyncratic locales and beings described in CoCD:Wyld might serve as seeds for the making of &amp;quot;lost&amp;quot; worlds in the Wyld, for the ST looking for just a little spur to direct one's imagination.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would imagine different Primordials handle insults differently. So maybe a pragmatic Primordial would find the burning effigy a playground of opportunity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-24T16:06:02-07:00","id":1320600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1320499#post1320499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I would imagine different Primordials handle insults differently. So maybe a pragmatic Primordial would find the burning effigy a playground of opportunity.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, what counts as &quot;pragmatic&quot; for a personified transcedent multi-souled cosmic titan sprung from primal chaos in the first place? What in the burned-out husk of an offended sibling's &quot;infectious anti-world&quot; might catch another's interest enough for it to repurpose instead of shaping something else <i>ex nihilo</i>?<br /> <br /> Maybe not a pure Primordial per se, but a Yozi or Neverborn might find things of interest in the dead not-Creation - those who play with shadows, smoke and mirrors. Dead things, those that were not truly born but made, possibilities glimpsed but unrealized. A secret playground/hideout for aspects of Szoreny, Ebon Dragon, dead titans that do not rest quietly in their tombs and who knows what else? Just a spur of moment thing...<br /> <br /> Anyway, I would guess beings of a less transcedent scale though possibly just as alien, if not more so, might have more motives of their own to take over &amp; repurpose such a place, what could lead to all kinds of strangeness, as i imagine the idea of wyld-native beings leaving home to colonize some pseudo-creation excite/offend the Raksha's sensibilities even more than the Creation-born do, leading to all kinds of conflict and complication.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 06-26-2019, 12:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-25T01:57:28-07:00","id":1320688,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't call the Primordials <i>trans</i>human, because that entails them having been human once and then transcending that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-25T01:58:34-07:00","id":1320689,"title":"","content":"I had a headcanon I never shared about that......","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-25T06:37:11-07:00","id":1320731,"title":"","content":"Don't forget the plothookiness that is <b>Yatani's Children</b>, whom claim to hail from another world, separated from it by some cataclysm, and seek to find traces of it, or perhaps a way back. (WFHW pg 126).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-25T09:44:03-07:00","id":1320773,"title":"","content":"I don't remember Cemunian, where's it from?<br /> <br /> I'm playing a multiverse crossover right now. People from alternate Creations have been whisked away to strange pocket dimensions that the Primordials created before Creation, as practice. Perhaps they're in the deep wyld, perhaps they're just elsewhere like Autochthon.<br /> My Zenith, Brother Alazar, has found himself (and one of his companions) in a realm of floating islands that drift up from the deep, freezing void below. Eventually the animals upon them are unfrozen by the great red sun above and begin their lives. But the animals must keep moving to lower islands, as all the islands eventually will fall up into the sun. <br /> <br /> Meanwhile, my Full Moon, Dr Soma, woke up in a jungle. She met refugees from other worlds; a Samurai, wild-man and werefox from a dying world being unmade by a Primordial song; and a Lunar and Raksha from a world that was invaded by Autocthonions, but defeated them.<br /> In this strange pre-Creation world we found ourselves in, we learnt there were once humans but they were all killed by the sea people. Now talking animals live in an industrial society with trucks and guns, where everyone is equal but some are more equal than orlthers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-25T09:52:42-07:00","id":1320774,"title":"","content":"IIRC, Cemunian was the primordial who created the Pseudo-Creation of Cajerron and sent it against Creation during the early-mid First Age. Its been ambiguous whether or not the primordial escaped the initial imprisonment at the end of the Primordial War or emerged spontaneously from the wyld after the Yozis were imprisoned.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24948-hamsandlich","name":"HamSandLich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24948_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-25T10:12:07-07:00","id":1320779,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HamSandLich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1320774#post1320774\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">IIRC, Cemunian was the primordial who created the Pseudo-Creation of Cajerron and sent it against Creation during the early-mid First Age. Its been ambiguous whether or not the primordial escaped the initial imprisonment at the end of the Primordial War or emerged spontaneously from the wyld after the Yozis were imprisoned.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Different Primodial. Cermunian made it before the imprisonment of Yozi, and UCS burned it. The one who exploded into the First Age was something with an R...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-25T10:16:00-07:00","id":1320780,"title":"","content":"Ah, Ramethus","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24948-hamsandlich","name":"HamSandLich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24948_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-25T11:35:58-07:00","id":1320794,"title":"","content":"I remember Ramethus, but where was this Cajerron and Cemunian talked about?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-25T11:44:37-07:00","id":1320798,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1320794#post1320794\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I remember Ramethus, but where was this Cajerron and Cemunian talked about?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Ink Monkeys Daystar series.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-25T20:58:17-07:00","id":1320884,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1320688#post1320688\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wouldn't call the Primordials <i>trans</i>human, because that entails them having been human once and then transcending that.</div> </div> </div> </div>A good point indeed, not the best choice of word on my part for certain.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1199576-other-worlds?p=1199654#p